          "text": "Témoignages: ROQUEFORT-SUR-GARONNE (31) 27.05.2022",
          "text_sha256": "cd20bdd8168b66242a429a04610443e30b449aaa8b1bd8ac3bee1fc7e18972b9"
        },
        {
          "end_ms": null,
